Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:25.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:28.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can I turn on the radio? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:35.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane, you can't keep doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:40.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,The last 17 occurrences have been predictable to the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.39,0:01:42.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane, you're an astrophysicist, not some storm chaser.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.97,0:01:44.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, there's a connection
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:47.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,between these atmospheric disturbances and my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:50.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik, I wouldn't have asked you to fly out here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.72,0:01:52.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,if I wasn't absolutely sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:53.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.15,0:01:55.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:01.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.17,0:02:11.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you said it was a subtle aurora!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:12.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:21.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get closer. - Right. Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:22.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:44.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am not dying for six college credits!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:07.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think that was legally your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:09.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the first aid Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:11.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor and don't be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.19,0:03:12.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:19.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:38.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:42.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,mankind accepted a simple truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:46.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,that they were not alone in this universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:52.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Some worlds man believed to be home to their gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:55.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Others, they knew to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:03.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,From a realm of cold and darkness came the Frost Giants,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:20.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,threatening to plunge the mortal world into a new ice age.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:32.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,But humanity would not face this threat alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:11.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our armies drove the Frost Giants
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:13.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,back into the heart of their own world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:18.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,The cost was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:21.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.23,0:05:23.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,their king fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:31.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the source of their power was taken from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:34.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,With the last great war ended,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:38.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,we withdrew from the other worlds and returned home
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:40.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,to the Realm Eternal,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:43.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Asgard
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:18.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here we remain as a beacon of hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.33,0:06:22.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,shining out across the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:26.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,And though we have fallen into man's myths and legends,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:30.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,it was Asgard
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:32.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,and its warriors
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:33.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,that brought peace
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,to the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:42.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,But the day will come
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:45.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,when one of you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:48.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,will have to defend that peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:50.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do the Frost Giants still live?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:52.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,When I'm king,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:56.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll hunt the monsters down and slay them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:58.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just as you did, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,A wise king
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:05.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,never seeks out war.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:12.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,But he must always be ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:26.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm ready, Father. - So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Only one of you can ascend to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:34.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,But both of you were born to be kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:57.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor Odinson,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:00.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,my heir,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,my firstborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:11.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,So long entrusted with the mighty hammer Mjolnir,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:14.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,forged in the heart of a dying star,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:18.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,its power has no equal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.09,0:09:20.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,as a weapon to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:23.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,or as a tool to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:26.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,'Tis a fit companion for a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:30.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have defended Asgard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:34.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,and the lives of the innocent across the Nine Realms
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:37.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,from the time of the great beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Though the day has come...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:08.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you swear to guard the Nine Realms?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:13.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,And do you swear to preserve the peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:15.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:17.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you swear
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:20.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,to cast aside all selfish ambition
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:23.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,and to pledge yourself only to the good of the Realms?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:25.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:27.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then, on this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:30.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I, Odin Allfather,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,proclaim you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:48.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Frost Giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.81,0:11:35.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Jotuns must pay for what they've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:38.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,They have paid, with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Destroyer did its work,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:43.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,the Casket is safe, and all is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:45.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,All is Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,They broke into the weapons vault!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,If the Frost Giants had stolen even one of these relics...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:53.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They didn't. - Well, I want to know why!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:58.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have a truce with Laufey, King of the Jotuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:03.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,He just broke your truce! They know you are vulnerable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:05.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,What action would you take?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.43,0:12:08.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,March into Jotunheim as you once did. Teach them a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:10.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Break their spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,so they'll never dare try to cross our borders again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:13.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're thinking only as a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.98,0:12:15.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,This was an act of war!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:17.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was the act of but a few, doomed to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:19.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look how far they got!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:21.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,We will find the breach in our defenses and it will be sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,As King of Asgard....
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.15,0:12:25.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you're not king!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:30.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not yer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:04.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's unwise to be in my company right now, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:08.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,This was to be my day of triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:12.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,It'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:14.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,In time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:17.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:21.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,If it's any consolation, I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:24.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,About the Frost Giants, about Laufey, about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:28.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,If they found a way to penetrate Asgard's defenses once,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:30.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,who's to say they won't try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:32.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Next time with an army. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:35.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do without defying Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. I know that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:41.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the only way to ensure the safety of our borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:42.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor, it's madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:45.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Madness? What sort of madness?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:48.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're going to Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:50.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:52.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't like a journey to Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,where you summon a little lightning and thunder,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:57.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,and the mortals worship you as a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:13:59.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:01.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,My father fought his way into Jotunheim,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:04.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,defeated their armies and took their Casket.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:06.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,We would just be looking for answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:07.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is forbidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:12.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,My friends, have you forgotten all that we have done together?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:15.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fandral, Hogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:18.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who led you into the most glorious of battles?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:19.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:22.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,And Volstagg, to delicacies so succulent,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:25.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,you thought you'd died and gone to Valhalla?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:27.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:28.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:30.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,And who proved wrong all who scoffed at the idea
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:33.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,that a young maiden could be one of the fiercest warriors
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:34.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,this realm has ever known?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:35.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:38.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,True, but I supported you, Sif.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:39.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,My friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:42.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,we're going to Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:34.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,You leave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:38.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good Heimdall... - You're not dressed warmly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:40.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:43.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you think that you can deceive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:45.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You must be mistaken... - Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:50.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall, may we pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.07,0:15:57.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never has an enemy slipped my watch until this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:16:00.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wish to know how that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:03.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then tell no one where we have gone until we've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:05.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:12.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened? Silver tongue turn to lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:16:58.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:02.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will honor my sworn oath to protect this realm as its Gatekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:06.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,If your return threatens the safety of Asgard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bifrost will remain closed to you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:12.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,and you'll be left to die in the cold waste of Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:14.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you just leave the bridge open for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:15.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,To leave the bridge open
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:17.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,would unleash the full power of the Bifrost
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:21.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,and destroy Jotunheim with you upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.49,0:17:23.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have no plans to die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:25.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,None do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:12.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:16.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:16.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:18.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hiding,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,as cowards always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:34.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've come a long way to die, Asgardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:37.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am Thor Odinson!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:39.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,We know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:41.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did your people get into Asgarol?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.31,0:19:55.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,The House of Odin is full of traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:58.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not dishonor my father's name with your lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:01.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your father is a murderer and a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.15,0:20:05.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,And why have you come here? To make peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:08.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You long for battle. You crave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:11.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a boy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:14.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,trying to prove himself a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:18.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, this "boy" has grown tired of your mockery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:27.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor, stop and think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:29.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look around you, we're outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:31.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Know your place, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:35.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know not what your actions would unleash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:39.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:43.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go now, while I still allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:58.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,We will accept your most gracious offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:12.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:19.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Run back home, little princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:21.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:27.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:49.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,At least make it a challenge for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:11.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.15,0:22:48.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let them touch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:32.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:35.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We must go! - Then go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.52,0:24:01.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.98,0:24:04.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.05,0:25:11.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.71,0:25:13.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Open the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:21.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Father! We'll finish them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.70,0:26:23.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.83,0:26:30.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Allfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.75,0:26:33.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,You look weary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.80,0:26:37.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Laufey,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.34,0:26:39.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,end this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.22,0:26:41.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your boy sought this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.93,0:26:43.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.81,0:26:47.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,And these are the actions of a boy, treat them as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.64,0:26:52.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and I can end this here and now, before there's further bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.07,0:26:56.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are beyond diplomacy now, Allfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.20,0:27:00.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,He'll get what he came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.57,0:27:01.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,War
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.20,0:27:03.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.24,0:27:06.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.39,0:27:31.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring us back?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.60,0:27:32.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.69,0:27:34.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What you've started? - I was protecting my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.57,0:27:36.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You cannot even protect your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.23,0:27:37.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,How can you hope to protect a kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.07,0:27:39.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get him to the healing room! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.86,0:27:43.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,There won't be a kingdom to protect if you're afraid to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.41,0:27:48.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Jotuns must learn to fear me, just as they once feared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.58,0:27:50.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's pride and vanity talking, not leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.12,0:27:54.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've forgotten everything I taught you about a warrior's patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.17,0:27:57.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,While you wait and be patient, the Nine Realms laugh at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.13,0:27:59.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,The old ways are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.38,0:28:02.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'd stand giving speeches while Asgard falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.13,0:28:05.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are a vain, greedy, cruel boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.76,0:28:08.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you are an old man and a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.44,0:28:16.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.61,0:28:19.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was a fool
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.32,0:28:21.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,to think you were ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.15,0:28:24.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.78,0:28:29.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor Odinson,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.50,0:28:34.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,you have betrayed the express command of your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.88,0:28:37.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Through your arrogance and stupidity,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.50,0:28:40.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,you've opened these peaceful realms and innocent lives
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.46,0:28:44.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,to the horror and desolation of war!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.22,0:28:54.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are unworthy of these realms!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.44,0:28:57.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're unworthy of your title!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.15,0:28:58.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're unworthy
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.40,0:29:05.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,of the loved ones you have betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.25,0:29:18.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I now take from you your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.50,0:29:22.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,In the name of my father
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.67,0:29:24.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,and his father before,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.18,0:29:27.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I, Odin Allfather, cast you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.56,0:29:37.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whosoever holds this hammer, if he be worthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.85,0:29:39.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,shall possess the power of Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.63,0:30:06.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think that was legally your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.34,0:30:08.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the first aid Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.18,0:30:09.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor and don't be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.39,0:30:17.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Does he need CPR? Because I totally know CPR.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.45,0:30:31.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.83,0:30:36.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.04,0:30:38.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.33,0:30:39.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.42,0:30:41.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can tell you're hammered. It's pretty obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.42,0:30:44.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. Erik, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.67,0:30:47.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to move quickly before this all changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.47,0:30:50.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane, we have to take him to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.39,0:30:52.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Father! - He's fine, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.80,0:30:56.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall! I know you can hear me! Open the Bifrost!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.89,0:30:58.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hospital. You go, I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.89,0:31:01.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You. What realm is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.48,0:31:02.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alfheim? Nornheim?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.11,0:31:04.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,New Mexico?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.32,0:31:07.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You dare threaten me, Thor, with so puny a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.03,0:31:14.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? He was freaking me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.24,0:31:16.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next time you decide to taser somebody,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.58,0:31:19.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,make sure he's already in the car, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.17,0:31:22.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.14,0:31:41.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Name?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.44,0:31:43.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,He said it was Thor?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.11,0:31:47.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,T-H-O-R.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.78,0:31:50.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And your relationship to him? - I've never met him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.49,0:31:51.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Until she hit him with a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.11,0:31:54.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I grazed him, but she tasered him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.08,0:31:56.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:31:59.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:01.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just taking a little blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.71,0:32:04.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,How dare you attack the son of Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.08,0:32:05.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need some help!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.92,0:32:08.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call security!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.84,0:32:11.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Security to ER 3, stat!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.86,0:32:26.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're no match for the Mighty...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.79,0:33:31.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't think this was just a magnetic storm, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.59,0:33:34.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, the lensing around these edges
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.51,0:33:36.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,is characteristic of an Einstein-Rosen Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.09,0:33:38.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:40.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I thought you were a science major? - Political science.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.39,0:33:42.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,She was the only applicant.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.31,0:33:44.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,An Einstein-Rosen Bridge is a theoretical connection
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.06,0:33:46.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,between two different points of space-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.39,0:33:47.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a wormhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.81,0:33:50.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Erik, look. What do you see? - Stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.90,0:33:52.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but not our stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.82,0:33:56.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,See, this is the star alignment for our quadrant this time of year,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.66,0:33:59.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,and unless Ursa Minor decided to take a day off,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.87,0:34:02.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,these are someone else's constellations.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.16,0:34:04.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.79,0:34:12.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.55,0:34:16.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I left something at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.19,0:34:34.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.25,0:34:50.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was on drugs or something. He just went nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.38,0:35:01.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.39,0:35:06.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just lost my most important piece of evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.68,0:35:07.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.81,0:35:09.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So now what? - We find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.06,0:35:11.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you see what he did in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.52,0:35:13.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure finding him is the best idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.40,0:35:15.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, our data can't tell us what it was like to be inside that event,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.82,0:35:18.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,and he can. So, we're gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.57,0:35:19.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.70,0:35:22.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,So we're gonna look all over New Mexico, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.41,0:35:23.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.04,0:35:29.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.08,0:35:33.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. I swear I'm not doing this on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.35,0:35:51.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got it, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.74,0:36:03.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, kick it in now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.25,0:36:13.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did it Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.27,0:36:37.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, we found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.66,0:36:48.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, for a crazy homeless person, he's pretty cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.12,0:36:53.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry I tased you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.54,0:36:57.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.88,0:37:06.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.22,0:37:10.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,My ex.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.02,0:37:15.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good with patients and bad with relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.02,0:37:17.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're the only clothes I had that would fit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.61,0:37:18.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,They will suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.73,0:37:20.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.82,0:37:22.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,This mortal form has grown weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.15,0:37:24.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need sustenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.67,0:37:45.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should never have let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.51,0:37:47.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,There was no stopping him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.09,0:37:49.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, at least he's only banished, not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.14,0:37:50.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which is what we'd all be
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.51,0:37:53.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,if that guard hadn't told Odin where we'd gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.61,0:38:01.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did the guard even know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.61,0:38:02.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.15,0:38:05.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.28,0:38:07.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I told him to go to Odin after we'd left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.03,0:38:09.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,He should be flogged for taking so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.45,0:38:11.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should never have reached Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.08,0:38:12.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You told the guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.29,0:38:14.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.29,0:38:16.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,And Thor's.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.21,0:38:18.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I had no idea Father would banish him for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.88,0:38:20.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Loki.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.71,0:38:24.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,You must go to the Allfather and convince him to change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.55,0:38:27.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if I do, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.22,0:38:30.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love Thor more dearly than any of you, but you know what he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.64,0:38:33.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's arrogant. He's reckless. He's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.35,0:38:35.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You saw how he was today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.60,0:38:37.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that what Asgard needs from its king?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.65,0:38:44.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,He may speak of the good of Asgard,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.11,0:38:46.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,but he's always been jealous of Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.57,0:38:49.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should be grateful to him, he saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.99,0:38:51.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Laufey said
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.99,0:38:54.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,there were traitors in the House of Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.25,0:38:59.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,A master of magic could bring three Jotuns into Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.25,0:39:02.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Loki's always been one for mischief,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.00,0:39:05.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,but you're talking about something else entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.94,0:39:27.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.95,0:39:32.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Am I cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.78,0:39:33.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.12,0:39:39.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,What am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.46,0:39:41.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.97,0:39:53.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,What more than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.73,0:40:01.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Casket wasn't the only thing you took from Jotunheim that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.48,0:40:02.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.24,0:40:10.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.41,0:40:13.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,In the aftermath of the battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.82,0:40:16.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I went into the temple and I found a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.16,0:40:24.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Small for a giant's offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.58,0:40:27.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Abandoned, suffering, left to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.50,0:40:30.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Laufey's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.84,0:40:33.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Laufey's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.01,0:40:38.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.85,0:40:42.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.35,0:40:46.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were knee-deep in Jotun blood, why would you take me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.77,0:40:48.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were an innocent child.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.36,0:40:52.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. You took me for a purpose. What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.03,0:40:58.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.70,0:41:02.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought we could unite our kingdoms one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.87,0:41:05.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bring about an alliance, bring about permanent peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.29,0:41:07.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.71,0:41:08.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.88,0:41:12.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,But those plans no longer matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.88,0:41:17.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I am no more than another stolen relic,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.22,0:41:19.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,locked up here until you might have use of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.76,0:41:21.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do you twist my words?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.31,0:41:23.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,You could have told me what I was from the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.39,0:41:24.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,why didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.64,0:41:25.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.40,0:41:28.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanted only to protect you from the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.82,0:41:31.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because I'm the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.65,0:41:33.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,parents tell their children about at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.99,0:41:35.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, no. - You know, it all makes sense now!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.99,0:41:38.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why you favored Thor all these years!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.83,0:41:41.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because no matter how much you claim to love me,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.16,0:41:45.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,you could never have a Frost Giant sitting on the throne of Asgard!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.44,0:42:06.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.60,0:42:09.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guards, please, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.61,0:42:17.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,How'd you get inside that cloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.61,0:42:20.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Also, how could you eat an entire box of Pop-Tarts
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.20,0:42:21.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,and still be this hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.54,0:42:29.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This drink, I like it. - I know. It's great, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.00,0:42:31.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Another!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.46,0:42:34.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Izzy. Little accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.80,0:42:39.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What was that? - It was delicious. I want another.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.97,0:42:42.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, you could have just said so. - I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.31,0:42:45.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, I mean, ask nicely. - I meant no disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.77,0:42:46.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Well, no more smashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.35,0:42:48.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.90,0:42:51.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.15,0:42:54.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.57,0:42:57.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,The usual, please, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.57,0:43:00.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You missed all the excitement out at the crater.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.49,0:43:03.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're saying some kind of satellite landed out in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.66,0:43:05.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we were having a good time with it
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.95,0:43:07.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,until the Feds showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.41,0:43:10.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me. - Did you say there was a satellite crash?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.33,0:43:11.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.46,0:43:13.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. This is going on Facebook. Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.26,0:43:18.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,What did it look like, the satellite?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.01,0:43:21.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about satellites, but it was heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.68,0:43:26.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, nobody could lift it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.27,0:43:28.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,They said it was radioactive. I had my hands all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.19,0:43:30.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.86,0:43:34.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fifty miles west of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.19,0:43:36.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't waste my time!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.98,0:43:38.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looked like the whole Army was coming when we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.83,0:43:45.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.99,0:43:47.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.70,0:43:49.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Fifty miles west of here. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.83,0:43:51.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,To get what belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.43,0:43:53.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you own a satellite now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.29,0:43:54.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not what they say it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.38,0:43:55.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.50,0:43:56.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,the government seems to think it's theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.92,0:43:58.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, you just intend to go in there and take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.05,0:44:00.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.59,0:44:02.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you take me there now,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.89,0:44:04.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything you wish to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.93,0:44:06.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Everything? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.22,0:44:09.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,All the answers you seek will be yours once I reclaim Mjolnir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.10,0:44:11.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Myeu-muh? What's Myeu-muh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.23,0:44:13.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I have a word, Jane?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.23,0:44:18.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.15,0:44:20.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,You saw what I saw last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.99,0:44:23.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is no coincidence. We have to find out what's in that crater.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.49,0:44:25.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I'm not talking about the crater, I'm talking about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.53,0:44:28.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- But he's promising us the answers. - He's delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.33,0:44:29.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to what he's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.45,0:44:33.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's talking about Mjolnir and Thor and Bifrost.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.71,0:44:35.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the stories I grew up with as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.00,0:44:38.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to drive him. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.05,0:44:41.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's dangerous, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.97,0:44:49.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.97,0:44:51.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then this is where we say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.90,0:45:03.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.32,0:45:06.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane Foster,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.16,0:45:07.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Erik Selvig,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.83,0:45:09.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darcy,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.54,0:45:10.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.50,0:45:15.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.50,0:45:18.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.52,0:45:40.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's my stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.82,0:45:46.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.20,0:45:48.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ms. Foster, I'm Agent Coulson with S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.28,0:45:49.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to mean something to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.03,0:45:51.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can't do this! - Jane!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.70,0:45:54.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane, this is a lot more serious than you realize. Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.62,0:45:56.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let it go? This is my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.92,0:45:59.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're investigating a security threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.09,0:46:01.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to appropriate your records and all your atmospheric data.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.88,0:46:04.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,By "appropriate," do you mean steal?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.38,0:46:06.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, this should more than compensate you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.18,0:46:07.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,for your trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.30,0:46:09.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't just buy replacements at Radio Shack,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.93,0:46:11.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I made most of this equipment myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.72,0:46:13.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure you can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.14,0:46:16.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure I can sue you for violating my constitutional rights!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.35,0:46:18.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ms. Foster, but we're the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.94,0:46:21.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,So are we!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.11,0:46:24.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm on the verge of understanding something extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.40,0:46:26.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,And everything I know about this phenomenon
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.28,0:46:28.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,is either in this lab or in this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.24,0:46:30.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you can't just take this away...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.87,0:46:34.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane! Easy! Easy. Jane...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.25,0:46:39.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.93,0:46:58.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Years of research,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.85,0:46:59.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.27,0:47:02.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,They even took my iPod.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.86,0:47:05.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What about the backups? - They took our backups.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.78,0:47:09.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,They took the backups of our backups. They were extremely thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.36,0:47:11.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just downloaded, like, 30 songs onto there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.78,0:47:14.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could you please stop with your iPod?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.24,0:47:17.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.00,0:47:20.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I knew this scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.42,0:47:23.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,The pioneer in gamma radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.00,0:47:26.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,S.H.I.E.L.D. showed up
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.38,0:47:29.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,and he wasn't heard from again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.88,0:47:33.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're not gonna do that to us. I'm gonna get everything back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.39,0:47:36.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, please. Let me contact one of my colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.31,0:47:38.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's had some dealings with these people before.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.02,0:47:41.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll e-mail him and maybe he can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.52,0:47:43.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,They took your laptop, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.66,0:47:55.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Allfather, we must speak with you urgently.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.51,0:48:10.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,My friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.84,0:48:12.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.76,0:48:15.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Father has fallen into the Odinsleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.18,0:48:19.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother fears he may never awaken again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.35,0:48:21.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,We would speak with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.77,0:48:24.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,She has refused to leave my father's bedside.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.19,0:48:29.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can bring your urgent matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.37,0:48:38.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.92,0:48:54.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,My King, we would ask that you end Thor's banishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.93,0:49:02.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,My first command cannot be to undo the Allfather's last.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.10,0:49:07.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're on the brink of war with Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.77,0:49:11.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our people need a sense of continuity,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.74,0:49:14.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,in order to feel safe in these difficult times.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.74,0:49:17.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,All of us must stand together
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.37,0:49:20.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,for the good of Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.50,0:49:24.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.42,0:49:27.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good. Then you will wait for my word. - If I may
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.04,0:49:33.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,beg the indulgence of Your Majesty to perhaps reconsider...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.72,0:49:34.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.86,0:50:39.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need a horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.12,0:50:45.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't have horses. Just dogs, cats, birds...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.41,0:50:47.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then give me one of those large enough to ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.25,0:50:49.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you still need a lift?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.05,0:50:57.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've never done anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.09,0:51:02.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you ever done anything like this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.56,0:51:04.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.89,0:51:06.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you're brave to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.48,0:51:09.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, they just stole my entire life's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.10,0:51:11.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't really have much left to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.40,0:51:13.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you're clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.48,0:51:17.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Far more clever than anyone else in this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.65,0:51:20.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Realm"? "Realm"?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.45,0:51:23.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You think me strange. - Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.74,0:51:26.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good strange or bad strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.29,0:51:28.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not quite sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.25,0:51:34.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.05,0:51:41.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,But who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.43,0:51:44.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.31,0:51:48.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.69,0:51:51.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,You promised me answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.86,0:51:56.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,What you seek, it's a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.03,0:51:58.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like an Einstein-Rosen Bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.07,0:52:00.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,More like a Rainbow Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.45,0:52:05.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,God, I hope you're not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.46,0:52:18.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I never get used to seeing him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.96,0:52:22.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's put it off for so long now, that I fear...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.30,0:52:27.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long will it last?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.47,0:52:31.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. This time it's different. We were unprepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.98,0:52:35.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,So why did he lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.48,0:52:40.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,He kept the truth from you so that you would never feel different.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.82,0:52:43.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are our son, Loki,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.66,0:52:45.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,and we, your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.66,0:52:51.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,We mustn't lose hope that your father will return to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.83,0:52:54.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,And your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.75,0:52:57.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,What hope is there for Thor?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.84,0:53:01.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's always a purpose to everything your father does.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.16,0:53:35.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's no satellite crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.87,0:53:37.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,They would have hauled the wreckage away,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.21,0:53:38.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,they wouldn't have built a city around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.21,0:53:43.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're going to need this. - What? Wait, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.05,0:53:48.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.80,0:53:52.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once I have Mjolnir, I will return the items they've stolen from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.64,0:53:53.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.02,0:53:56.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Look what's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.40,0:53:59.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think you're just gonna walk in, grab our stuff and walk out?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.36,0:54:01.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I'm going to fly out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.32,0:54:12.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, feed from the keyhole can barely penetrate the cloud cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.41,0:54:13.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tech's barely working as it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.79,0:54:16.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,with all the interference that thing's giving off.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.42,0:54:18.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we've got a commercial aircraft coming right over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.92,0:54:22.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Southwest Airlines, flight 5434.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.09,0:54:23.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reroute it like all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.05,0:54:25.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.67,0:54:28.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got something outside the fence, west side.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.68,0:54:30.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Delancey, Jackson.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.38,0:54:32.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,West side perimeter Go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.56,0:54:35.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.69,0:54:46.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Delancey, Jackson. Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.62,0:54:56.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Agent down. We've got a perimeter breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.51,0:55:13.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've reached Dr Erik Selvig. Please leave me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.47,0:55:17.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi, Erik, it's me. Don't worry, I'm fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.98,0:55:20.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,but just in case you don't hear from me in the next hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.44,0:55:23.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,just come by the crater site and try and find me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.40,0:55:26.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did exactly what you told me not to. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.49,0:55:27.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,So sorry. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.63,0:55:47.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Entering south tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.88,0:55:51.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Negative, negative. - I have no comms.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.48,0:56:07.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Target sighted, east tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.57,0:56:09.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need eyes up high, with a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.05,0:56:36.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moving north!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.23,0:56:45.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,What have we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.31,0:56:46.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a massive electromagnetic surge
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.90,0:56:48.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,coming off that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.11,0:56:49.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Systems are barely coping.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.07,0:56:51.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barton? Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.20,0:56:54.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want me to slow him down, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.03,0:56:58.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or are you sending in more guys for him to beat up?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.49,0:57:00.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.84,0:57:16.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're big.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.26,0:57:18.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fought bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.14,0:58:06.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Better call it, Coulson, 'cause I'm starting to root for this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.67,0:58:28.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Last chance, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.75,0:58:30.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait. I want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.86,0:59:42.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, show's over. Ground units, move in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.54,1:00:37.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,He committed a crime. He's in jail!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.63,1:00:39.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't just leave him there! - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.05,1:00:42.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,You didn't see what I saw!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.38,1:00:44.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look! - Look, it's Myeu-muh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.14,1:00:50.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where'd you find this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.52,1:00:51.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,The children's section.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.73,1:00:54.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to show you how silly his story was.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.23,1:00:56.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you're the one who's always pushing me
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.23,1:00:58.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,to chase down every possibility, every alternative!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.44,1:01:00.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about science, not magic!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.99,1:01:03.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, magic's just science that we don't understand yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.11,1:01:05.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Arthur C. Clarke. - Who wrote science fiction.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.82,1:01:08.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A precursor to science fact! - In some cases, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.41,1:01:10.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, if there is an Einstein-Rosen Bridge,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.16,1:01:11.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,then there's something on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.62,1:01:13.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,And advanced beings could have crossed it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.50,1:01:14.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.67,1:01:17.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,A primitive culture like the Vikings might have worshipped them as deities.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.67,1:01:19.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes, exactly. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.18,1:01:28.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,You made my men,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.43,1:01:30.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,some of the most highly trained professionals in the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.97,1:01:33.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,look like a bunch of minimum-wage mall cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.60,1:01:36.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,that's hurtful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.90,1:01:41.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,In my experience, it takes someone who's received similar training
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.82,1:01:42.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,to do what you did to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.53,1:01:47.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell me where you received your training?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.41,1:01:51.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pakistan? Chechnya? Afghanistan?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.25,1:01:55.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, you strike me more as the soldier of fortune type.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.33,1:01:59.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where was it? South Africa?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.67,1:02:04.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Certain groups pay very well for a good mercenary like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.93,1:02:08.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.27,1:02:15.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,One way or another, we find out what we need to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.10,1:02:17.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're good at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.15,1:02:24.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.95,1:02:33.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Loki! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.79,1:02:35.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I had to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.96,1:02:38.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.63,1:02:40.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me. Is it Jotunheim?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.96,1:02:42.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me explain to Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.46,1:02:43.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Father is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.97,1:02:51.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.14,1:02:54.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your banishment,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.81,1:02:57.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,the threat of a new war,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.06,1:03:00.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,it was too much for him to bear.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.48,1:03:05.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mustn't blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.49,1:03:07.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know that you loved him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.91,1:03:11.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tried to tell him so, but he wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.87,1:03:16.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was so cruel to put the hammer within your reach,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.25,1:03:18.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,knowing that you could never lift it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.54,1:03:23.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,The burden of the throne has fallen to me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.39,1:03:32.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I come home?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.97,1:03:35.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,The truce with Jotunheim is conditional upon your exile.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.31,1:03:39.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, but couldn't we find a way...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.37,1:03:42.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,And Mother has forbidden your return.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.78,1:03:47.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.82,1:03:51.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.33,1:03:58.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.00,1:04:01.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.09,1:04:09.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.85,1:04:15.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.28,1:04:29.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.53,1:04:31.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good bye?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.11,1:04:33.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just got back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.40,1:05:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.32,1:05:12.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's got a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.16,1:05:19.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,His name is Donald Blake?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.08,1:05:21.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Donald Blake.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.96,1:05:23.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have dangerous coworkers, Dr. Selvig.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.00,1:05:27.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was distraught when he found out that you've taken all our research.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.42,1:05:30.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was years of his life, gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.84,1:05:35.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can understand how a man could go off like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.59,1:05:37.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,A big, faceless organization like yours
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.80,1:05:39.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,coming in with their jackbooted thugs and...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.93,1:05:43.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's how he put it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.52,1:05:44.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,That still doesn't explain
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.64,1:05:46.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,how he managed to tear through our security.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.60,1:05:49.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Steroids! He's a bit of a fitness nut.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.61,1:05:52.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.45,1:05:58.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,It says here that he's an M.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.03,1:06:01.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, he is! Or he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.41,1:06:03.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,He switched careers and became a physicist.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.16,1:06:05.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,A brilliant physicist.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.04,1:06:08.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's a wonderful man. He's a man in pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.80,1:06:13.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Donny, Donny, Donny!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.05,1:06:18.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,There you are. You're gonna be all right. I'm taking you home now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.48,1:06:33.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Selvig!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.07,1:06:37.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just keep him away from the bars.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.99,1:06:39.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.16,1:06:44.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where are we going? - To get a drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.33,1:06:45.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Follow them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.09,1:06:54.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I had it all backwards.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.34,1:06:57.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I had it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.26,1:07:04.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not a bad thing finding out that you don't have all the answers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.35,1:07:07.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,You start asking the right questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.36,1:07:15.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,For the first time in my life,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.44,1:07:20.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what I'm supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.12,1:07:24.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyone who's ever going to find his way in this world
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.16,1:07:27.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,has to start by admitting he doesn't know where the hell he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.21,1:07:30.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.96,1:07:33.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, don't thank me. I only did it for Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.88,1:07:37.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Her father and I taught at university together.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.88,1:07:39.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.47,1:07:41.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,He never listened.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.89,1:07:44.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Neither did I.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.72,1:07:47.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,My father was trying to teach me something,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.89,1:07:49.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I was too stupid to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.90,1:07:52.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you're delusional
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.92,1:07:54.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,or if you're pulling some kind of con,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.02,1:07:56.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.44,1:07:57.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just care about her.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.15,1:08:01.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've seen the way she looks at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.91,1:08:07.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I swear to you, I mean her no harm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.75,1:08:08.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.41,1:08:12.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll buy you another round,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.12,1:08:13.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,and you leave town tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.59,1:08:20.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two boilermakers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.02,1:09:13.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.10,1:09:17.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,After all I've done for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.57,1:09:24.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you're the one who showed us the way into Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.53,1:09:26.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was just a bit of fun, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.87,1:09:30.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,To ruin my brother's big day.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.70,1:09:35.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,And to protect the realm from his idiotic rule for a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.83,1:09:39.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.59,1:09:47.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will conceal you and a handful of your soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.72,1:09:52.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,lead you into Odin's chambers, and you can slay him where he lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.14,1:09:54.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why not kill him yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.94,1:09:59.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I suspect that the Asgardians would not take kindly
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.69,1:10:01.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,to a king who had murdered his predecessor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.11,1:10:06.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once Odin is dead, I will return the Casket to you
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.28,1:10:11.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,and you can return Jotunheim to all its...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.16,1:10:15.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Glory.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.63,1:10:21.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Accept.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.30,1:10:28.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,What troubles you, Gatekeeper?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.14,1:10:31.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I turned my gaze upon you in Jotunheim,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.64,1:10:34.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,but could neither see you nor hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.81,1:10:36.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were shrouded from me,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.14,1:10:38.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,like the Frost Giants that entered this realm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.65,1:10:41.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Perhaps your senses have weakened after your many years of service.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.07,1:10:43.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps someone has found a way
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.82,1:10:46.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,to hide that which he does not wish me to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.16,1:10:50.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have great power, Heimdall.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.74,1:10:54.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did Odin ever fear you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.50,1:10:58.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. - And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.42,1:11:01.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because he is my king and I am sworn to obey him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.84,1:11:06.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was your king and you're sworn to obey me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.84,1:11:07.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.43,1:11:14.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.48,1:11:18.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you will open the Bifrost to no one
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.27,1:11:21.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,until I have repaired the damage that my brother has done.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.87,1:11:37.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.21,1:11:40.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's fine. Not injured at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.13,1:11:42.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.75,1:11:44.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What happened? - We drank, we fought,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.63,1:11:46.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,he made his ancestors proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.59,1:11:48.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put him on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.64,1:12:03.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I still don't think you're the God of Thunder.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.90,1:12:06.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you ought to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.16,1:12:18.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are these your chambers?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.08,1:12:22.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's more of a temporary living situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.58,1:12:27.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I don't usually have guests.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.09,1:12:30.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, I never have guests.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.09,1:12:35.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not the right place for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.26,1:12:37.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.02,1:12:42.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can we go outside?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.94,1:12:44.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.86,1:12:52.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I come up here sometimes when I can't sleep
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.24,1:12:54.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,or I'm trying to reconcile particle data,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.80,1:12:56.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,or when Darcy's driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.62,1:13:00.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I come up here a lot, actually, now that I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.96,1:13:06.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.96,1:13:10.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've been very kind to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.17,1:13:13.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I've been far less grateful than you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.55,1:13:15.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I hit you with my car a couple times,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.34,1:13:17.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,so I think that kind of evens things out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.81,1:13:21.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I had it coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.48,1:13:28.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.07,1:13:31.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.65,1:13:35.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was all I could get back. I'm sorry it's not as much as I promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.16,1:13:37.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, this is great! This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.49,1:13:39.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't have to start from scratch now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.16,1:13:41.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.17,1:13:47.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.00,1:13:50.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,S.H.l.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.09,1:13:51.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever they are,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.92,1:13:54.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,they're gonna do everything in their power
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.63,1:13:57.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,to make sure this research never sees the light of day.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.51,1:13:58.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.43,1:14:01.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. You must not give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.60,1:14:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You must finish what you've started. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.85,1:14:05.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.94,1:14:07.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.86,1:14:13.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your ancestors called it magic, and you call it science.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.95,1:14:16.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I come from a place where they're one and the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.30,1:14:32.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.88,1:14:37.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,My father explained it to me like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.09,1:14:38.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,that your world
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.93,1:14:41.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,is one of the Nine Realms of the Cosmos,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.85,1:14:44.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,linked to each other by the branches of Yggdrasil,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.23,1:14:47.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,the Worlds Tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.40,1:14:50.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now you see it every day without realizing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.40,1:14:53.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,The images glimpsed through... What did you call it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.90,1:14:55.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,This Hooble Telescope.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.24,1:14:59.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hubble. - Hubble Telescope.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.16,1:15:03.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.08,1:15:05.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, the Nine Realms.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.25,1:15:08.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, there is Midgard, which is Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.08,1:15:10.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Alfheim.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.92,1:15:13.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vanaheim. Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.42,1:15:15.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,And Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.26,1:15:18.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,And that's where I come from.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.61,1:15:36.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.36,1:15:43.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our dearest friend banished, Loki on the throne,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.41,1:15:46.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Asgard on the brink of war, yet you've managed to consume
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.95,1:15:50.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,four wild boar, six pheasant, a side of beef,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.12,1:15:53.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,and two casks of ale. Shame on you. Don't you care?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.38,1:15:56.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not mistake my appetite for apathy!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.71,1:15:58.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.88,1:15:59.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.22,1:16:03.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We all know what we have to do. - We must go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.22,1:16:08.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,We must find Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.73,1:16:10.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's treason.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.98,1:16:12.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,To hell with treason, it's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.98,1:16:14.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor would do the same for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.07,1:16:17.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now shush.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.99,1:16:21.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall might be watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.24,1:16:28.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall demands your presence.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.42,1:16:34.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.00,1:16:38.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,You would defy the commands of Loki, our king,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.17,1:16:41.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,break every oath you have taken as warriors,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.68,1:16:44.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,and commit treason to bring Thor back?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.18,1:16:45.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.26,1:16:47.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you'll help us?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.52,1:16:50.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am bound by honor to our king.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.14,1:16:52.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I cannot open the bridge to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.02,1:16:54.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Complicated fellow, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.94,1:16:56.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.03,1:16:59.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.67,1:17:20.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What the hell was that? - I don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.09,1:17:21.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,We got massive energy readings out of nowhere
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.47,1:17:23.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,and then they just disappeared. Fifteen miles due northwest.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.05,1:17:25.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.37,1:17:51.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.70,1:17:53.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.84,1:18:03.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Base to Team 2, we've got activity outside the town.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.76,1:18:04.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay on your target.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.23,1:18:16.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ensure my brother does not return.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.57,1:18:22.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Destroy everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.08,1:18:34.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.30,1:18:44.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is there a Renaissance Fair in town?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.38,1:18:45.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.38,1:18:47.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.30,1:18:52.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Base, we've got Xena, Jackie Chan and Robin Hood.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.47,1:18:55.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a beautiful theory, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.48,1:18:59.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you won't be able to convince the scientific community of any of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.81,1:19:01.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not without hard evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.07,1:19:03.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.41,1:19:11.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,My friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.53,1:19:14.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is good! This is good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.95,1:19:16.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.62,1:19:19.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me. Lady Sif and the Warriors Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.04,1:19:23.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,My friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.67,1:19:26.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've never been happier to see anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.55,1:19:28.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you should not have come.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.14,1:19:31.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're here to take you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.89,1:19:34.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know I can't go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.89,1:19:38.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,My father
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.48,1:19:40.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,is dead because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.56,1:19:43.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I must remain in exile.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.90,1:19:45.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.53,1:19:47.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,your father still lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.54,1:20:05.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Loki, how did you get the Jotuns into Asgarol?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.96,1:20:09.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think the Bifrost is the only way in and out of this realm?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.30,1:20:10.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are secret paths between the worlds
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.93,1:20:13.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,to which even you, with all your gifts, are blind.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.72,1:20:16.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I have need of them no longer, now that I am king.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.97,1:20:18.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I say, for your act of treason,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.93,1:20:21.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,you are relieved of your duties as Gatekeeper,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.77,1:20:23.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,and no longer citizen of Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.98,1:20:26.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then I need no longer obey you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.13,1:20:50.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get somebody from Linguistics down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.33,1:21:19.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Was somebody else coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.25,1:21:24.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that one of StarK's?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.38,1:21:27.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. The guy never tells me anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.67,1:21:32.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.01,1:21:35.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are using unregistered weapons technology.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.80,1:21:36.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.72,1:21:41.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.31,1:21:46.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.20,1:21:55.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane, you have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.66,1:21:57.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you gonna do? - I'm staying here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.91,1:21:59.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor's going to fight with us!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.91,1:22:01.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,My friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.66,1:22:05.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just a man. I'll only be in the way, or worse, get one of you killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.75,1:22:07.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I can help get these people to safety.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.09,1:22:10.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're staying, then so am I.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.42,1:22:12.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We'll need some time. - You'll have it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.38,1:22:14.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, move it, people!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.76,1:22:17.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody out! Use the back door.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.55,1:22:19.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go, hurry! You can eat later.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.61,1:22:34.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep it distracted.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.17,1:22:51.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,For Asgard!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.00,1:23:28.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.68,1:23:45.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go. Now. Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:16.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sif. Sif, you've done all you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.84,1:24:19.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I will die a warrior's death.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.34,1:24:21.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stories will be told of this day.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.55,1:24:24.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Live, and tell those stories yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.85,1:24:28.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.90,1:24:38.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,You must return to Asgard. You have to stop Loki.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.11,1:24:40.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.61,1:24:43.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, my friends. I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.87,1:24:45.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.08,1:24:51.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to fall back. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.50,1:24:52.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.38,1:25:01.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.47,1:25:10.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.46,1:25:41.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brother, whatever I have done to wrong you,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.51,1:25:44.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,whatever I have done to lead you to do this,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.84,1:25:46.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.39,1:25:49.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,But these people are innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.02,1:25:54.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Taking their lives will gain you nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.86,1:26:03.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,So take mine
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.11,1:26:05.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,and end this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.46,1:26:20.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.56,1:26:37.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.23,1:26:40.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. it's not over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.15,1:26:43.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.40,1:26:45.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.57,1:26:46.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.91,1:26:54.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.56,1:27:13.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.50,1:27:41.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're spiking. - Levels increase!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.96,1:27:43.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whosoever holds this hammer,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.17,1:27:47.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,if he be worthy,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.55,1:27:52.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,shall possess the power of Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.24,1:28:09.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.74,1:28:14.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. No. No! - Come!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.64,1:28:39.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh. My. God.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.67,1:29:50.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, is this how you normally look?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.92,1:29:51.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,More or less.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.84,1:29:54.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a good look.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.01,1:29:58.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,We must go to the Bifrost site. I would have words with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.18,1:29:59.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.18,1:30:04.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Donald?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.60,1:30:07.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think you've been completely honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.15,1:30:08.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Know this, Son of Coul.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.61,1:30:11.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and I, we fight for the same cause, the protection of this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.69,1:30:13.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,From this day forward, you can count me as your ally
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.82,1:30:16.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,if you return the items you have taken from Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.91,1:30:18.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stolen. - Borrowed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.45,1:30:21.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course, you can have your equipment back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.66,1:30:23.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna need it to continue your research.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.62,1:30:26.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you like to see the bridge we spoke of?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.08,1:30:29.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.88,1:30:32.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, I need to debrief you!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.10,1:30:41.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.96,1:31:09.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall, open the Bifrost.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.84,1:31:18.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.35,1:31:23.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.81,1:31:27.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,He doesn't answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.94,1:31:29.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then we are stranded.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.56,1:31:32.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall! If you can hear me, we need you now!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.90,1:31:36.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall! We need you now!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.58,1:31:43.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heimdall!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.43,1:32:01.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I must go back to Asgard, but I give you my word,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.76,1:32:05.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will return for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.69,1:32:13.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.45,1:32:28.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.18,1:32:47.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get him to the healing room!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.73,1:32:50.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Leave my brother to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.17,1:33:16.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Said
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.00,1:33:21.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,you can still hear and see what transpires around you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.01,1:33:25.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope it's true,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.01,1:33:29.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,so that you may know
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.18,1:33:36.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,your death came at the hand of Laufey.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.45,1:33:48.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,And your death came by the son of Odin.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.87,1:33:55.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Loki!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.33,1:33:56.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You saved him!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.30,1:34:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I swear to you, Mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.68,1:34:06.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,that they will pay for what they've done today.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.51,1:34:07.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Loki.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.30,1:34:09.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.39,1:34:12.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd return to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.90,1:34:19.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell her
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.57,1:34:23.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,how you sent the Destroyer to kill our friends, to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.15,1:34:24.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.24,1:34:26.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why, it must have been enforcing Father's last command.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.74,1:34:29.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a talented liar, Brother. Always have been.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.24,1:34:31.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's good to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.91,1:34:35.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now if you'll excuse me, I have to destroy Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.08,1:35:18.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.50,1:35:21.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Bifrost will build until it rips Jotunheim apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.69,1:35:44.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.82,1:35:48.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why have you done this?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.57,1:35:52.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,To prove to Father that I am the worthy son.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.41,1:35:55.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,When he wakes, I will have saved his life.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.33,1:35:58.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will have destroyed that race of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.12,1:36:00.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I will be true heir to the throne!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.63,1:36:02.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't kill an entire race!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.71,1:36:04.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.84,1:36:10.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what is this newfound love for the Frost Giants?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.09,1:36:14.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You could have killed them all with your bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.60,1:36:16.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I've changed. - So have I.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.43,1:36:19.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now fight me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.86,1:36:24.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I never wanted the throne!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.11,1:36:27.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I only ever wanted to be your equal.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.78,1:36:30.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will not fight you, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.86,1:36:32.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not your brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.03,1:36:34.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I never was.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.41,1:36:35.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Loki, this is madness.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.49,1:36:38.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it madness?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.96,1:36:40.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.54,1:36:42.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.88,1:36:47.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. What happened to you on Earth that turned you so soft?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.67,1:36:51.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it was that woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.39,1:36:54.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.68,1:36:58.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe, when we're finished here, I'll pay her a visit myself!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.14,1:37:43.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thor!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.82,1:37:51.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.83,1:38:04.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.79,1:38:48.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at you,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.63,1:38:52.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,the Mighty Thor,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.05,1:38:58.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,with all your strength,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.89,1:39:01.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,and what good does it do you now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.89,1:39:06.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me, Brother? There's nothing you can do!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.66,1:39:25.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.67,1:39:31.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you destroy the bridge, you'll never see her again!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.68,1:39:42.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.84,1:40:22.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could have done it, Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.85,1:40:25.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could have done it!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.10,1:40:27.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,For you!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.14,1:40:29.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,For all of us!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.81,1:40:33.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,NO, Loki.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.91,1:40:42.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Loki, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.16,1:40:46.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.58,1:40:51.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.10,1:41:09.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.96,1:42:24.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then, with a mighty bellow,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.05,1:42:29.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I flew into the giant metal creature and laid him low!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.31,1:42:32.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that another way of saying you fell on your huge ass?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.98,1:42:38.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, falling was a tactic lulling the Destroyer...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.16,1:42:56.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,My Queen, I'm so sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.84,1:43:03.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.51,1:43:07.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,He mourns for his brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.84,1:43:10.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.18,1:43:12.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,He misses hen
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.77,1:43:15.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,The mortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.53,1:43:33.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll be a wise king.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.71,1:43:40.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,There will never be a wiser king than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.54,1:43:43.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or a better father.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.10,1:43:57.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have much to learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.27,1:44:00.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.78,1:44:07.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someday, perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.03,1:44:10.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I shall make you proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.58,1:44:20.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've already made me proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.35,1:44:37.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,So Earth is lost to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.68,1:44:39.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.69,1:44:42.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,There is always hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.69,1:44:48.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you see her?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.11,1:44:52.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.12,1:44:58.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have the particle detectors!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.12,1:45:00.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darcy, do you have the S.H.I.E.L.D. satellite codes?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.29,1:45:02.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Have you seen my taser?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.46,1:45:03.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,How is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.96,1:45:06.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,In the car. Come on, Jane!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.38,1:45:08.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,She searches for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.04,1:53:19.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Selvig.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.79,1:53:24.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you're the man behind all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.13,1:53:29.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's quite a labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.88,1:53:33.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was thinking they're taking me down here to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.98,1:53:43.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been hearing about the New Mexico situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.81,1:53:48.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your work has impressed a lot of people who are much smarter than I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.57,1:53:50.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have a lot to work with.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.15,1:53:54.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Foster Theory. A gateway to another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.12,1:53:56.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.83,1:54:00.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.50,1:54:06.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Legend tells us one thing, history, another.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.17,1:54:11.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,But every now and then, we find something that belongs to both.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.18,1:54:20.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.27,1:54:21.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Power, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.93,1:54:23.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we can figure out how to tap it,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.81,1:54:33.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's worth a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.61,1:54:37.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's worth a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:53.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,(新墨西哥州 普恩特 安蒂卡)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:25.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:28.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我能开收音机吗? - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:35.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮,你不该老是搞这玩意儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:40.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,这最后第17个气旋很快就可侦测完了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.39,0:01:42.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮,你是天体学家,不是风暴追逐者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.97,0:01:44.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你说,有某种关连
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:47.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,在那里的几个气旋和我的研究之间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:50.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾瑞克,我又不会要求你飞行到那上面去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.72,0:01:52.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,这我敢保证
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:53.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.15,0:01:55.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你该来看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:01.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.17,0:02:11.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为你说的只是极光而已!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:12.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:21.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 靠近一点 - 这回是好现象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:22.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在做什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:44.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不会为了几个学分去送命啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:07.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肯定都是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:09.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去拿急救箱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:11.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托你千万别死啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.19,0:03:12.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:19.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,他从哪来的啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:37.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,(挪威  滕斯贝格城  西元965年)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:38.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,一旦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:42.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,人们开始信仰一个简单的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:46.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这宇宙中我们就不孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:52.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,在某些世界里,人们学会景仰天神
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:55.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,但有时候得学会去畏惧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:03.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,当黑暗来临,大地冻结,一个"寒冰巨人之王"出现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:20.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,威胁要将人类别世界变成新的冰河时期
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:32.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,但人类别并非单独对抗这个威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:11.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的大军抵挡着寒冰巨人大军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:13.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,将他们击退回他们的国度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:18.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,但也付出极大的代价
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:21.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.23,0:05:23.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,寒冰王战败了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:31.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且,我们带走了他们"神器"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:34.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,当大战终告结束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:38.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们也开始回家,回到我们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:40.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,那永恒国度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:43.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯嘉特(神的领域)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:18.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,在此,我们保持着希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.33,0:06:22.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,将希望的光芒透过星辰绽放
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:26.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然人类别将我们当作神话或传说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:30.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,但阿斯嘉特
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:32.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,及其战士们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:33.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,把和平带给
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:42.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,终究有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:45.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们其中一位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:48.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,将必须维持这个和平
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:50.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,寒冰巨人还活着吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:52.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,有天我当国王时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:56.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我将追杀此怪物并痛宰他们!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:58.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像跟随您的脚步一样,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,有智慧的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:05.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,不该求战的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:12.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是你们应该做好准备随时应战
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:26.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我准备好了,父亲 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你俩只能有一人戴上皇冠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:34.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你们都生来就是要当王的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托喔.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:57.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔·奥丁之子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:00.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的继任者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的长子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:11.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,掌握着雷神之锤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:14.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,由垂死之星锻造而成的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:18.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,它的威力无可比拟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.09,0:09:20.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,不仅是毁灭的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:23.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,更是创造的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:26.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,他值得拥有一个国王的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:30.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们捍卫着阿斯嘉特
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:34.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,及其穿越九大国度的无辜生灵们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:37.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,就从此时此刻的伟大起点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽管这一天来...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:08.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你发誓将保卫九大国度吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:13.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,并发誓保持和平吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:15.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:17.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:20.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,将抛开自私的野心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:23.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,只专一的奉献自己保卫神之国度?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发誓!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:27.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,值此今日
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:30.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我,奥丁,身为人父
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,宣告你成为...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:48.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,"寒冰巨人"来袭!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.81,0:11:35.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,巨人该为所做的付出代价!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:38.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们已经付出生命代价了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们没得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:43.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,且"神器"也安好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:45.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,安好?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们闯入了武器库!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,万一寒冰巨人抢走这些神器的之一...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:53.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们没成功 - 我要知道为什么!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:58.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟劳菲有个和平协议,寒冰巨人王
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:03.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,他刚违反和平协议!他们知道你变得脆弱了!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:05.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,换做你会怎做呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.43,0:12:08.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要去卓顿海姆,就想您以前一样,给它们个教训
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:10.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,打击它们士气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,让他们不敢再越雷池一步
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:13.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只是一个战士的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.98,0:12:15.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是战争的做法啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:17.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样的做法只是注定失败
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:19.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看他们侵入到多深的内部了!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:21.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会找出安检漏洞并加强防范
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,身为阿斯加特的国王...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.15,0:12:25.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你还不是国王!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:30.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,还不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:04.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,此时来找我谈是不智的,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:08.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,这该是我立功的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:12.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,会到的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:14.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,适时的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:17.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:21.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是安慰你,我认为你是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:24.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,有关寒冰巨人所作所为之类别
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:28.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果它们能找到安检漏洞侵入阿斯加特
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:30.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,难保他们下回不会再做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:32.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 而且带大军来袭 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:35.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你还是不能做出违背父亲的事来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我知道你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:41.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,唯一要做的是确保边界安全
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:42.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔,太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:45.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,疯狂?什么叫疯狂?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:48.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们将前往"乔登海姆"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:50.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:52.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,那可不像去地球旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,随意带着闪电和雷鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:57.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,让人类别像神般尊崇你而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:13:59.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,那可是:"乔登海姆"啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:01.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我父亲曾在"乔登海姆"作战过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:04.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,他曾击败过大军,让敌方大败
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:06.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想去找答案
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:07.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是禁忌之地!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:12.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友们,你们忘了我们曾一起做过的事吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:15.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,范达尔,格里姆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:18.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,是谁让你们参与了光荣的战役?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:19.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:22.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,佛尔斯提格,我优秀的战将
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:25.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,是谁让你免于死在瓦哈拉的战役?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:27.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:28.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:30.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,那又是谁向各位证明了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:33.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,既使是一个少女也能成为一代战将
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:34.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,在国度里人尽皆知?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:35.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然是我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:38.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,但我支持你的说法,希芙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:39.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:42.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们将前往:"乔登海姆"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:34.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:38.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好海姆达尔... - 你们不仅让我感到警戒而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:40.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:43.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们以为能蒙骗我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:45.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一定是误会了 - 够了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:50.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔,让我们走?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.07,0:15:57.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到昨天以前我不曾让任何敌人进得来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:16:00.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很想搞懂是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:03.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到我们回来前别告诉任何人就好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:05.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,同意吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:12.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么啦?舌头打结了啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:16:58.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们曾发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:02.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,身为守护者,必将遵守誓言护卫国度
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:06.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你们回来时阿斯嘉特的安全受到威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,彩虹桥将保持关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:12.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你们将会永远被遗忘在"乔登海姆"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:14.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就不能直接开启门给我们吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:15.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果随意开启彩虹桥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:17.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,将会释放所有的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:21.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,同时摧毁"乔登海姆"以及你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.49,0:17:23.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我今天没送死的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:25.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:12.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,早知道不该来的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:16.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:16.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们人呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:18.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,藏起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,一向都是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:34.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们大老远来就想送死,阿斯嘉特人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:37.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是托尔奥丁之子!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:39.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们知道你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:41.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们是怎样渗透进来我们阿斯加特的?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.31,0:19:55.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们有许多背叛者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:58.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,不准你用谎言污蔑我父之名!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:01.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你父亲是个杀人犯跟小偷!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.15,0:20:05.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你想来这里?寻求和平?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:08.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你距离上回大战太久了,而你想参与
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:11.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,好让你这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:14.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,证明你是个大男子汉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:18.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,"这小子"厌烦听你再继续胡说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:27.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔,暂停并思考
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:29.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看四周我们人数不多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:31.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,弟弟.搞清楚你的地位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:35.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不懂我将释放出的能量有多危险
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:39.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:43.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,离开吧,否则我不手下留情的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:58.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们接受您提出的协议
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:12.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:19.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,滚回家吧,小公主
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:21.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:27.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,下一位?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:49.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,少说给我个挑战吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:11.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,还不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.15,0:22:48.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让它们碰触到你!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:32.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:35.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 该离开了! - 哪走啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.52,0:24:01.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.98,0:24:04.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.05,0:25:11.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.71,0:25:13.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,打开彩虹桥!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:21.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,父王!我们一起消灭他们!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.70,0:26:23.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.83,0:26:30.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,老爹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.75,0:26:33.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看来累了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.80,0:26:37.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,劳菲
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.34,0:26:39.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.22,0:26:41.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你儿子引起的事端
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.93,0:26:43.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.81,0:26:47.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,确实是我儿子搞的小孩子把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.64,0:26:52.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你大可以在此平息此事,避免引起日后的屠杀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.07,0:26:56.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,此事已经不再是和平协议的一项了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.20,0:27:00.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,他将遭受随之而来的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.57,0:27:01.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,战争
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.20,0:27:03.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,与死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.24,0:27:06.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.39,0:27:31.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,为何要带我们回来?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.60,0:27:32.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道你闯了什么大祸了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.69,0:27:34.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么? - 你我是在保卫家园
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.57,0:27:36.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你连朋友都差点保护不了!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.23,0:27:37.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在你还想保卫家园?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.07,0:27:39.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,带伤者去医疗大厅!快去!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.86,0:27:43.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,害怕有所作为只怕到时都没家园可保护了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.41,0:27:48.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,寒冰王要学会畏惧我,正如畏惧你一般
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.58,0:27:50.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,只会大谈有多自豪或多有自尊没用
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.12,0:27:54.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我教你的所有事情还包括:战士精神
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.17,0:27:57.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你再拖延应战时机,那其他九大国度都会嘲笑我们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.13,0:27:59.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们老生常谈的说:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.38,0:28:02.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你越不出声,到时神之国度将毁
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.13,0:28:05.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是个自负的小子,贪婪又残酷!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.76,0:28:08.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你是个老头跟笨蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.44,0:28:16.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.61,0:28:19.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.32,0:28:21.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,笨到相信你真的准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.15,0:28:24.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,父王...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.78,0:28:29.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔·奥丁之子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.50,0:28:34.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你已经违背了国王命令
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.88,0:28:37.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,起因你的傲慢以及愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.50,0:28:40.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你扰乱了和平之地,也害了无辜百姓
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.46,0:28:44.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,带来了恐惧与战争!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.22,0:28:54.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你配不上这神之国度!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.44,0:28:57.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你配不上你的头衔!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.15,0:28:58.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不值得
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.40,0:29:05.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,为人所爱戴,你背叛了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.25,0:29:18.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我将取回你的神力!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.50,0:29:22.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,以我众神之父
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.67,0:29:24.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,其上之父之名
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.18,0:29:27.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我,奥丁国度之父,我诅咒你!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.56,0:29:37.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论雷神之锤落入谁手中,只要有资格的人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.85,0:29:39.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,都可以拥有雷神之力
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.63,0:30:06.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肯定都是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.34,0:30:08.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去拿急救箱
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.18,0:30:09.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托啊,千万别死啊你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.39,0:30:17.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,他好像需要CPR?,但我不会做CPR
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.45,0:30:31.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,他从哪来的啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.83,0:30:36.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.04,0:30:38.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,锤子?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.33,0:30:39.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,锤子(音同酒醉)呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.42,0:30:41.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,你肯定是酒醉了,很明显
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.42,0:30:44.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾瑞克,快来看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.67,0:30:47.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得在改变前快点拍下照片
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.47,0:30:50.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮,得快带他去医院
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.39,0:30:52.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 父王! - 你看他还好好的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.80,0:30:56.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔!我知道你听得见!快开启彩虹桥!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.89,0:30:58.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你带他去医院,我留下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.89,0:31:01.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你,这是哪个国度?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.48,0:31:02.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱尔菲海姆?,多伦海姆?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.11,0:31:04.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,新墨西哥州啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.32,0:31:07.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你敢威胁我,托尔,带着如此不堪的武器?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.03,0:31:14.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎样?我被吓到了啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.24,0:31:16.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,下回你打算电击某个人之前
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.58,0:31:19.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,请先确定他人已在车上,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.17,0:31:22.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮!上车
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.14,0:31:41.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,姓名?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.44,0:31:43.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说他叫做托尔?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.11,0:31:47.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,"T-H-O-R"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.78,0:31:50.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们跟他是什么关系? - 我从未见过他
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.49,0:31:51.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到他被车撞了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.11,0:31:54.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发现了他,然后她电击了他
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.08,0:31:56.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:31:59.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:01.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,先抽点血验验
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.71,0:32:04.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,好大胆,我可是奥丁之子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.08,0:32:05.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要帮忙!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.92,0:32:08.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,快叫保安!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.84,0:32:11.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,保安快到3号病房!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.86,0:32:26.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们都不是我的对手...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.79,0:33:31.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不认为这只是太阳风暴是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.59,0:33:34.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看,景象的边缘
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.51,0:33:36.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像"爱因斯坦·罗森桥"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.09,0:33:38.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:40.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我以为你还是天体研究者? - 政治系的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.39,0:33:42.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,她只是工读生而已
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.31,0:33:44.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,"爱因斯坦·罗森桥"是在理论上连接
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.06,0:33:46.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,两个不同时空的宇宙点
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.39,0:33:47.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是虫洞
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.81,0:33:50.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 艾瑞克,你看见什么了? - 星星啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.90,0:33:52.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,但不是只有星体排列的图罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.82,0:33:56.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不只是今年的星象排列如此
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.66,0:33:59.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,且这不是说星象可以乱改变的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.87,0:34:02.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是来自不同星系的影像
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.16,0:34:04.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,过来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.79,0:34:12.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,这不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.55,0:34:16.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们好像忘了什么东西在医院了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.19,0:34:34.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不可能!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.25,0:34:50.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是嗑药什么的了,他就是发疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.38,0:35:01.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.39,0:35:06.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我刚搞丢了一个重要的确实证据
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.68,0:35:07.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,实证
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.81,0:35:09.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 现在呢? - 找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.06,0:35:11.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看到那里刚发生的事了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.52,0:35:13.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得找到他不是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.40,0:35:15.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的资料能让我们了解的有限
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.82,0:35:18.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,而他却能告诉我们真相,所以要找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.57,0:35:19.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.70,0:35:22.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算翻遍新墨西哥州,对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.41,0:35:23.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.04,0:35:29.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,做什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.08,0:35:33.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,我不是故意的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.35,0:35:51.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.74,0:36:03.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,加油!用力!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.25,0:36:13.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,有用吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.27,0:36:37.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官,我找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.66,0:36:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,以一个游民来说,他算满帅的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.12,0:36:53.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉我电击了你
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.54,0:36:57.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,抱歉!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.88,0:37:06.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.22,0:37:10.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,前男友的名牌
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.02,0:37:15.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,那段关系也维持的不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.02,0:37:17.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我能找到适合你的唯一衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.61,0:37:18.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,衣服可以穿
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.73,0:37:20.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.82,0:37:22.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,凡人的样子让我变虚弱
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.15,0:37:24.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要进食
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.67,0:37:45.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不该放逐他的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.51,0:37:47.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我阻止不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.09,0:37:49.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少还好是放逐,不是处死
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.14,0:37:50.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们早都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.51,0:37:53.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果守护者没有告诉奥丁我们去哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.61,0:38:01.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,守护者怎知我们上哪去?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.61,0:38:02.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.15,0:38:05.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.28,0:38:07.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要他在我们离开后通报父王
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.03,0:38:09.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我担心这趟行程拖太久
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.45,0:38:11.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,怕在"乔登海姆"待太久
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.08,0:38:12.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你告密的?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.29,0:38:14.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可救了大家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.29,0:38:16.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,也救了托尔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.21,0:38:18.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我并不知道父王将如何逞罚他
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.88,0:38:20.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,洛基
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.71,0:38:24.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你必须向父王求情,要求他改变心意
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.55,0:38:27.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,那又能如何呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.22,0:38:30.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我比你们更爱托尔,但你们了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.64,0:38:33.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他很自傲,他很蛮干,他很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.35,0:38:35.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们亲眼目睹的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.60,0:38:37.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,神之国度能接受这种国王吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.65,0:38:44.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,他能声称自己很爱"阿斯嘉特"国度
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.11,0:38:46.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,但他总是一直在忌妒托尔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.57,0:38:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少我们该感谢他救了咱们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.99,0:38:51.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,劳菲说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.99,0:38:54.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,在奥丁王宫里有反叛者
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.25,0:38:59.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,魔法也可以至少送进3人进入"阿斯嘉特"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.25,0:39:02.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,洛基也许有时比较调皮点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.00,0:39:05.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你们这样指控可是很严重的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.94,0:39:27.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.95,0:39:32.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我被诅咒了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.78,0:39:33.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.12,0:39:39.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我算什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.46,0:39:41.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.97,0:39:53.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,那又怎样呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.73,0:40:01.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个箱子不是唯一一个你从"乔登海姆"带回的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.48,0:40:02.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.24,0:40:10.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.41,0:40:13.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,当大战后
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.82,0:40:16.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我到神庙里发现了一个婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.16,0:40:24.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,娇小,也似乎很脆弱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.58,0:40:27.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,被遗落在那里似乎在等死
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.50,0:40:30.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,"寒冰王"劳菲之子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.84,0:40:33.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,劳菲之子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.01,0:40:38.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.85,0:40:42.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.35,0:40:46.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有你自己的血脉继承者,为何还要养我?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.77,0:40:48.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只是无辜的小孩罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.36,0:40:52.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,你肯应有原因要带走我的,是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.03,0:40:58.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.70,0:41:02.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认为我们可以在某日结盟
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.87,0:41:05.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,进而追求永和的和平
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.29,0:41:07.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,透过你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.71,0:41:08.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.88,0:41:12.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,但计划赶不上变化了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.88,0:41:17.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我变成无用之物
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.22,0:41:19.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,被抢走还软禁在此好让你改天有机会利用
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.76,0:41:21.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你别曲解我的意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.31,0:41:23.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你大可告诉我,我是何身世的人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.39,0:41:24.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为何不说?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.64,0:41:25.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.40,0:41:28.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想着实的保护着你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.82,0:41:31.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就是所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.65,0:41:33.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,从小听到大恶魔?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.99,0:41:35.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,不 - 就不肯告诉我实情!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.99,0:41:38.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,为何这些年你偏爱托尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.83,0:41:41.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为不管你如何口口声声说爱我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.16,0:41:45.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,但也不可能让寒冰王之子坐拥王位的!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.44,0:42:06.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,卫兵!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.60,0:42:09.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,卫兵,快帮忙!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.61,0:42:17.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是怎么跑进那云团里的啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.61,0:42:20.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有,你怎么能在吃掉一整箱的果酱馅饼后
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.20,0:42:21.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是这么饥饿啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.54,0:42:29.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这饮料,我喜欢 - 很不错吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.00,0:42:31.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,再来一杯!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.46,0:42:34.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,有点小意外
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.80,0:42:39.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你头壳坏去吗? - 我是说很好喝,再来一杯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.97,0:42:42.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那你用讲的就好啊 - 我刚才讲了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.31,0:42:45.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是说用"讲"的就好 - 我也没恶意
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.77,0:42:46.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,那么别砸杯子了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.35,0:42:48.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.90,0:42:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.15,0:42:54.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.57,0:42:57.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,餐点照旧啊西斯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.57,0:43:00.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可错过陨石坑那边好玩的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.49,0:43:03.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看过很多卫星坠毁在沙漠地的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.66,0:43:05.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,我们本来可好好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.95,0:43:07.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到调查局来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.41,0:43:10.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 你刚提到有"卫星坠毁"的事?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.33,0:43:11.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.46,0:43:13.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊,帮你贴到Facebook上秀一下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.26,0:43:18.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,请问那个卫星长得怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.01,0:43:21.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不太懂什么卫星,但是它很重
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.68,0:43:26.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,根本抬不动它
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.27,0:43:28.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人说要小心辐射污染之类别的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.19,0:43:30.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,在哪个方位?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.86,0:43:34.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,往西方50英里处
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.19,0:43:36.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不想浪费时间!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.98,0:43:38.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,到时会来一堆军队
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.83,0:43:45.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,混蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.99,0:43:47.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.70,0:43:49.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 往西边50英里处走啊 - 为何?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.83,0:43:51.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,去找回我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.43,0:43:53.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说那卫星是你的啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.29,0:43:54.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,不适他们谈论的"那个东西"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.38,0:43:55.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论它是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.50,0:43:56.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,但政府机构似乎认为那个东西是他们的了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.92,0:43:58.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你就打算去到那里后,拿了就走?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.05,0:44:00.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.59,0:44:02.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你带我过去
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.89,0:44:04.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我将告诉你所有你想知道的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.93,0:44:06.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 所有的? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.22,0:44:09.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我将告诉你有关雷神之锤的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.10,0:44:11.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷神之锤?,什么是雷神之锤?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.23,0:44:13.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,能说句话吗,珍妮?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.23,0:44:18.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托别这样做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.15,0:44:20.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也看到昨晚发生的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.99,0:44:23.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是巧合,我们得去解陨石坑的真相的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.49,0:44:25.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我不是指陨石坑的事,我是指"他"!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.53,0:44:28.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们答应他就好啊 - 他疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.33,0:44:29.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你听他在讲什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.45,0:44:33.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在说什么雷神之锤、托尔、彩虹桥
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.71,0:44:35.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过是咱从小听过的故事罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.00,0:44:38.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,就载他过去而已
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.05,0:44:41.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,有危险啊,珍妮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.97,0:44:49.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,我无法带你过去
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.97,0:44:51.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们就该在这里道别
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.90,0:45:03.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.32,0:45:06.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮·佛斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.16,0:45:07.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.83,0:45:09.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,妲西
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.54,0:45:10.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,后会了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.50,0:45:15.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.50,0:45:18.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,回去办事了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.52,0:45:40.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿那是我的东西啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.82,0:45:46.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里在做什么事情啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.20,0:45:48.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,佛斯特小姐,我是卡申探员,来自神盾局
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.28,0:45:49.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,那应该是对我暗示什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.03,0:45:51.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不能做这些! - 简!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.70,0:45:54.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮,情况比你想像的还糟糕,放手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.62,0:45:56.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,放手?这是我毕生的研究啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.92,0:45:59.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果有机密上的安全威胁时
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.09,0:46:01.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,您的研究资料跟纪录将会提供协助
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.88,0:46:04.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,恰当地说,你们用偷窃的?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.38,0:46:06.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,这些钱当作弥补您的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.18,0:46:07.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,一些损失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.30,0:46:09.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,在无线电器材公司是买不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.93,0:46:11.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我那些设备是我自己做的!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.72,0:46:13.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我确定您可重新开始研究的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.14,0:46:16.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可确定的是大可控告你们侵犯我的宪法保障权!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.35,0:46:18.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,佛斯特小姐,我们是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.94,0:46:21.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.11,0:46:24.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我正将解开一些未解的奇异现象之谜
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.40,0:46:26.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,关于这种现象我所知道的每一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.28,0:46:28.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是在实验室就是在书里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.24,0:46:30.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你不可就拿走啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.87,0:46:34.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮!放松!放松,珍妮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.25,0:46:39.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢您的合作
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.93,0:46:58.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,多年的研究成果
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.85,0:46:59.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,没了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.27,0:47:02.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,连我iPod随身听也拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.86,0:47:05.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那备份资料呢? - 也被拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.78,0:47:09.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,连备份的备份资料也都拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.36,0:47:11.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,里面装了了30首,mp3然后
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.78,0:47:14.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托别再提你的iPod好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.24,0:47:17.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些人是谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.00,0:47:20.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认识一个科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.42,0:47:23.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,是研究迦玛射线的先驱(指绿巨人浩克)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.00,0:47:26.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,他曾提神盾局的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.38,0:47:29.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,就下落不明了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.88,0:47:33.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不能这样对待我,我要拿回所有的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.39,0:47:36.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,请让我先连络我以前的一个同事
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.31,0:47:38.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,他曾跟这些家伙接触过的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.02,0:47:41.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,给他先发个e-mail,也许他帮得上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.52,0:47:43.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们也抢走你的电脑了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.66,0:47:55.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,父王啊,我们得先跟您说几句话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.51,0:48:10.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.84,0:48:12.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥丁父王呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.76,0:48:15.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,父王正在沉睡当中
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.18,0:48:19.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,母王也担心他不会在醒来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.35,0:48:21.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们跟女王说话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.77,0:48:24.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,女王不愿离开父王身边
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.19,0:48:29.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们大可跟我报告有何急事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.37,0:48:38.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们的"王"!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.92,0:48:54.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,吾王我希望赦免托尔的罪罚
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.93,0:49:02.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我第一个命令不能违反父王的最后一个命令
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.10,0:49:07.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们正在跟"乔登海姆"开战中
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.77,0:49:11.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的百姓需要和平
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.74,0:49:14.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,在此危机时刻为了需要安全感
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.74,0:49:17.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都该协手同心
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.37,0:49:20.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了"阿斯嘉特"国度
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.50,0:49:24.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.42,0:49:27.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们只等我一声令下罢了 - 恕我直言
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.04,0:49:33.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,国王是否多需考量一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.72,0:49:34.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这样!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.86,0:50:39.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要一匹马!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.12,0:50:45.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只有猫狗鸟类别等宠物罢了...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.41,0:50:47.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,那给我一个能让我骑乘的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.25,0:50:49.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,你还需要搭个便车吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.05,0:50:57.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不曾如此的乱来过
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.09,0:51:02.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以前有这样做过吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.56,0:51:04.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,随时随地都会
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.89,0:51:06.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你很敢于这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.48,0:51:09.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些家伙偷走我毕生心血
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.10,0:51:11.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就没什么事情我不敢做的了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.40,0:51:13.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你挺聪明是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.48,0:51:17.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,感觉你比国度里很多人聪明似的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.65,0:51:20.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,"国度"?"国度"?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.45,0:51:23.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 听来很奇怪 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.74,0:51:26.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,听来是好是坏呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.29,0:51:28.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不确定啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.25,0:51:34.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.05,0:51:41.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你到底是谁啊你?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.43,0:51:44.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.31,0:51:48.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,很快你便知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.69,0:51:51.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你答应给我答案的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.86,0:51:56.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在找所谓的"虫洞"吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.03,0:51:58.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说:"爱因斯坦·罗森桥"?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.07,0:52:00.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们称之为:彩虹桥
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.45,0:52:05.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,真希望你没疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.46,0:52:18.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不忍看到他变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.96,0:52:22.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,他一直沉睡着,让我感到害怕...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.30,0:52:27.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还能撑多久呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.47,0:52:31.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道,这回状况不同,我们没做好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.98,0:52:35.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,那他为何对我说谎?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.48,0:52:40.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,他隐瞒真相只为了怕你感觉到与众不同
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.82,0:52:43.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我们的儿子,洛基
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.66,0:52:45.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.66,0:52:51.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不可放弃希望,希望你父王能回到我们身边
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.83,0:52:54.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,关于你兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.75,0:52:57.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔会怎样呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.84,0:53:01.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,那正是你父亲对托尔所要表达的用意
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.16,0:53:35.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,那可不是卫星坠落的景象!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.87,0:53:37.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们应该是把残骸全拖走了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.21,0:53:38.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们应该不会在坠落区建个城市吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.21,0:53:43.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你需要这个 - 什么?等等,为何?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.05,0:53:48.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,待在原地
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.80,0:53:52.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,一旦我成功潜入那里,我答应帮你拿回你的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.64,0:53:53.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.02,0:53:56.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好,你认真看看那里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.40,0:53:59.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为你可大喇喇走进去,拿了东西就走人是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.36,0:54:01.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我用"飞"的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.32,0:54:12.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官,有不明飞行物似乎穿过虫洞飞来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.41,0:54:13.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,电子设备因此几乎不工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.79,0:54:16.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为那个飞行物发出了干扰作用
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.42,0:54:18.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,并且我们看到一架民航机正在经过领空
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.92,0:54:22.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,西南航空的5434号班机
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.09,0:54:23.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有其他飞行物
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.05,0:54:25.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.67,0:54:28.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,有其他东西正在咱的防御线边缘,在西边
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.68,0:54:30.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,德兰西,这是杰克森
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.38,0:54:32.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,请查明西方维护区状况
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.56,0:54:35.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.69,0:54:46.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,德兰西,这是杰克森,请回报
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.62,0:54:56.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人员伤亡,防卫线被突破了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.51,0:55:13.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你拨的电话没回应,想留言给艾瑞克请说
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.47,0:55:17.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾瑞克,是我,我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.98,0:55:20.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是万一我一小时后没回拨给你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.44,0:55:23.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我正在做你叫我别干的事,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.40,0:55:26.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我正在陨石坑忙点事情之类别的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.49,0:55:27.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.63,0:55:47.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人硬闯通道!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.88,0:55:51.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拒绝,拒绝 - 我没看到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.48,0:56:07.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,1号通道需要支援
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.57,0:56:09.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要武装支援
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.05,0:56:36.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他往北方跑了!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.23,0:56:45.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,现况如何呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.31,0:56:46.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一股大量的电磁浪涌
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.90,0:56:48.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,从那个东西出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.11,0:56:49.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,系统快撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.07,0:56:51.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴顿?请说
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.20,0:56:54.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要挡下他吗,长官?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.03,0:56:58.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是你要让更多手下被挨揍呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.49,0:57:00.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我再告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.84,0:57:16.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.26,0:57:18.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我打败过比你更行的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.14,0:58:06.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得快下命令,卡森,这家伙越来越难搞了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.67,0:58:28.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后机会,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.75,0:58:30.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,我想静观其变
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.86,0:59:42.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,搞怪秀结束,把他抓起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.54,1:00:37.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,他已认罪,也入狱了!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.63,1:00:39.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不能弃他而不顾啊 - 为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.05,1:00:42.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你从没看过我所看见的!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.38,1:00:44.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 看! - 看,是雷神之锤
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.14,1:00:50.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,在哪发现的?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.52,1:00:51.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,童话故事里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.73,1:00:54.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想向你证明他的故事是多么愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.23,1:00:56.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你是一直鞭策我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.23,1:00:58.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,要竭尽所能去发掘真相的啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.44,1:01:00.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是叫你研究科学,不是研究魔法!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.99,1:01:03.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,但魔法是我们科学还无法验证的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.11,1:01:05.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 亚瑟.克拉克的铭言 - 那是谁在写科幻小说呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.82,1:01:08.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 至少有依靠一些科学根据吧! - 某些状况之下是的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.41,1:01:10.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果"爱因斯坦·罗森桥"存在
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.16,1:01:11.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么虫洞理论存在的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.62,1:01:13.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许可以跨越另一个宇宙!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.50,1:01:14.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.67,1:01:17.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,像维京人那样的原始文明就会把他们当神灵一样供奉
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.67,1:01:19.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的!太对了,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.18,1:01:28.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你伤了我们一些探员
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.43,1:01:30.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些都是世界上受到高度专业训练的探员
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.97,1:01:33.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,变得好像淑辣般脆弱
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.60,1:01:36.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,身受痛苦啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.90,1:01:41.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,依我经验判断那样的行为,肯定受过高专业的训练
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.82,1:01:42.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,好让你对付他们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.53,1:01:47.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉我你在哪里受训的?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.41,1:01:51.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴基斯坦?车臣?阿富汗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.25,1:01:55.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,感觉你又很像佣兵
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.33,1:01:59.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,在南非服役过吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.67,1:02:04.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,很多财团会付大笔佣金雇请你这种佣兵的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.93,1:02:08.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.27,1:02:15.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论如何,我们会查出我们想知道的事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.10,1:02:17.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这我们很在行的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.15,1:02:24.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,别乱跑啊你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.95,1:02:33.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,洛基!你来这做什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.79,1:02:35.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得见你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.96,1:02:38.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.63,1:02:40.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟"神之国度"的事有关吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.96,1:02:42.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我跟父王解释
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.46,1:02:43.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,父王死了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.97,1:02:51.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.14,1:02:54.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的放逐
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.81,1:02:57.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,正威胁着一场战争
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.06,1:03:00.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,但风险太大了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.48,1:03:05.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这你得自责
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.49,1:03:07.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你爱父王
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.91,1:03:11.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我试着跟父王解释,他也不听
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.87,1:03:16.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,夺走你能使用雷神之槌的法力是很残酷
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.25,1:03:18.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,既使知道你已不能举起它
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.54,1:03:23.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,如今国王的重担落在我头上了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.39,1:03:32.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能回家了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.97,1:03:35.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,神之国度的停战协议,包括了放逐你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.31,1:03:39.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,但没有其它方法...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.37,1:03:42.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,母后也同意你的禁令
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.78,1:03:47.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,该说再见了,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.82,1:03:51.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我深表遗憾
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.33,1:03:58.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.00,1:04:01.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我该对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.09,1:04:09.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢你的来访
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.85,1:04:15.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,永别了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.28,1:04:29.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.53,1:04:31.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.11,1:04:33.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才刚进来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.40,1:05:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.32,1:05:12.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人来访
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.16,1:05:19.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,他叫唐纳·布雷克?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.08,1:05:21.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,唐纳·布雷克博士
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.96,1:05:23.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有个危险的同事,席维克博士
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.00,1:05:27.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,他发狂了,当他看到你们毁掉了他所有的研究成果
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.42,1:05:30.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是他多年的心血,没了!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.84,1:05:35.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能理解一个男人是怎么做到那样的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.59,1:05:37.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个像你们这样的庞大隐秘的组织
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.80,1:05:39.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,带着穿长统靴的暴徒闯进来,并且...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.93,1:05:43.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以他会有这样的行为
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.52,1:05:44.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,这也不足以说明
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.64,1:05:46.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是如何躲过卫兵的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.60,1:05:49.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,服用类胆固醇,他是个健身狂
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.61,1:05:52.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.45,1:05:58.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,资料上显示他是"医学教授"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.03,1:06:01.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯,是啊!或者以前是
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.41,1:06:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他转行当了科学家了物理领域
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.16,1:06:05.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,好个聪明的物理学家
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.04,1:06:08.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是个好人,虽深受痛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.80,1:06:13.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,唐尼,唐尼啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.05,1:06:18.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这儿,你会没事的,我带你回家去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.48,1:06:33.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,席维克博士
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.07,1:06:37.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让他喝酒了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.99,1:06:39.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.16,1:06:44.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们要去哪? - 喝一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.33,1:06:45.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,追踪他们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.09,1:06:54.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我做错了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.34,1:06:57.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,全部都做错了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.26,1:07:04.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不必全部的问题都知道答案,也是不赖
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.35,1:07:07.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时只要问对问题就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.36,1:07:15.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,有生以来第一次
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.44,1:07:20.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道自己要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.12,1:07:24.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个人都能找到出路的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.16,1:07:27.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是还不知道出路在哪罢了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.21,1:07:30.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢你的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.96,1:07:33.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,别谢我,我是帮忙珍妮而做的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.88,1:07:37.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,他父亲跟我曾一起在大学教书
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.88,1:07:39.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是好人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.47,1:07:41.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我从没把话听进去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.89,1:07:44.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.72,1:07:47.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我父亲总想教会我一些事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.89,1:07:49.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我愚蠢到无法理解他想说的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.90,1:07:52.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道你是在妄想
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.92,1:07:54.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是你想对着干
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.02,1:07:56.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不在乎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.44,1:07:57.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只在乎她
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.15,1:08:01.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我了解她看着你的眼神
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.91,1:08:07.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我向你发誓,我不会伤害她
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.75,1:08:08.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.41,1:08:12.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我再请你多喝一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.12,1:08:13.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你今晚离开这城镇吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.59,1:08:20.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,来两杯深水炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.02,1:09:13.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.10,1:09:17.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我为你做这么多事后?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.57,1:09:24.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来就是你指引我们侵入"阿斯嘉特"的人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.53,1:09:26.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得挺好玩罢了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.87,1:09:30.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,故意搞乱我大哥加冕的好日子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.70,1:09:35.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,还顺便保护我们国度免于被他的愚蠢所害
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.83,1:09:39.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.59,1:09:47.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我将把你跟你的战士给隐藏得很好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.72,1:09:52.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,领你到奥丁父王的寝宫,然后你可以杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.14,1:09:54.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你何不自己动手杀了他?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.94,1:09:59.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认为晚辈还是别
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.69,1:10:01.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀害前辈比较仁慈些
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.11,1:10:06.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,一旦奥丁父王一死,我就归还你的法力之源
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.28,1:10:11.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你将可以重返"乔登海姆"还原你昔日的...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.16,1:10:15.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,荣耀
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.63,1:10:21.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我接受
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.30,1:10:28.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,有何问题吗,守护者?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.14,1:10:31.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我把彩虹之门朝向"乔登海姆"
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.64,1:10:34.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,却只能看见你但听不见你的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.81,1:10:36.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想隐瞒我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.14,1:10:38.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像寒冰巨人曾侵入这里一般
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.65,1:10:41.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许在你任职这么久之后你的感官退化了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.07,1:10:43.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,也可能是有发现什么方法
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.82,1:10:46.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,好隐藏自己不被人发现似的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.16,1:10:50.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有很好的神力,海姆达尔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.74,1:10:54.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥丁父王曾畏惧过你吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.50,1:10:58.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 为何?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.42,1:11:01.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为他是我的国王,我宣示过忠诚!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.84,1:11:06.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果是国王,你也会对我宣誓效忠
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.84,1:11:07.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.43,1:11:14.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.48,1:11:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就别再开启彩虹桥
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.27,1:11:21.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我弥补好我老哥所做的错事之前
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.87,1:11:37.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊,还好吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.21,1:11:40.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,他很好,一点也没受伤
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.13,1:11:42.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.75,1:11:44.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了? - 我们大醉,又干架
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.63,1:11:46.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,让观众大呼过瘾
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.59,1:11:48.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他放床上
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.64,1:12:03.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还是不相信你是雷神
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.90,1:12:06.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你应该当雷神
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.16,1:12:18.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是您住的地方?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.08,1:12:22.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是暂住的小窝而已
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.58,1:12:27.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,真抱歉很少有访客来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.09,1:12:30.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,事实上没访客来过啦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.09,1:12:35.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一个人惯了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.26,1:12:37.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.02,1:12:42.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,到外面坐坐吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.94,1:12:44.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.86,1:12:52.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有时睡不着会跑来这而
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.24,1:12:54.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者整理一下我的思绪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.80,1:12:56.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者妲西搞得我很烦时
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.62,1:13:00.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,想想我还真常跑来这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.96,1:13:06.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴你没事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.96,1:13:10.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们对我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.17,1:13:13.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可能不值得如此相待
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.55,1:13:15.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你被我的车撞两次了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.34,1:13:17.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们算扯平了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.81,1:13:21.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.48,1:13:28.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.07,1:13:31.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.65,1:13:35.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我顺手偷回的,抱歉我没拿回所有东西
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.16,1:13:37.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不,很够了!这是...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.49,1:13:39.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不用重新开始画那些素描图了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.16,1:13:41.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.17,1:13:47.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.00,1:13:50.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,神盾局的人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.09,1:13:51.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论如何
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.92,1:13:54.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们大可以运用公权力
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.63,1:13:57.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,确保这些研究再也见不到日光
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.51,1:13:58.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,珍妮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.43,1:14:01.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说,你不要放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.60,1:14:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你必须要在开始就结束 - 为何?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.85,1:14:05.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你作对的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.94,1:14:07.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.86,1:14:13.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们先人曾叫它魔法,而你称它为科学
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.95,1:14:16.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我却来自你们所宣称的这一切事物
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.30,1:14:32.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.88,1:14:37.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我父王是这样跟我解释的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.09,1:14:38.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.93,1:14:41.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,是这九大国度的其中一个
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.85,1:14:44.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们彼此互相牵连着
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.23,1:14:47.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,称之世界之树
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.40,1:14:50.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你每天都在看却不了解含意
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.40,1:14:53.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,图像透过这个...你管这个叫什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.90,1:14:55.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫哈勃望远镜
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.24,1:14:59.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哈伯 - 抱歉哈伯望远镜
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.16,1:15:03.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,多说一点
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.08,1:15:05.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里的九大国度
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.25,1:15:08.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是米德加得,就是地球
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.08,1:15:10.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着是爱菲海姆
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.92,1:15:13.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,安纳海姆,卓顿海姆
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.42,1:15:15.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯加德
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.26,1:15:18.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我正来自那个地方
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.61,1:15:36.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,珍妮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.36,1:15:43.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的好友被放逐,而洛基正要被加冕
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.41,1:15:46.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,"阿斯嘉特"正面临战争边缘,而你还在这里大吃大喝
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.95,1:15:50.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,四头野猪肉,六只野鸡,半只牛肉
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.12,1:15:53.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,吃饭而已,你们真是丢脸,你们不在乎吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.38,1:15:56.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,别在我面前胡言乱语,坏了我胃口!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.71,1:15:58.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,停!住手!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.88,1:15:59.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.22,1:16:03.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们都知道该怎么做 - 我们该出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.22,1:16:08.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定要找到托尔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.73,1:16:10.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是背叛
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.98,1:16:12.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,才不是背叛,是自杀
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.98,1:16:14.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔也会为我们这样做的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.07,1:16:17.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.99,1:16:21.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔,还在看守着
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.24,1:16:28.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔召见各位
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.42,1:16:34.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.00,1:16:38.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们打算违背"我们国王"洛基的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.17,1:16:41.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们甘愿打破战士的誓言
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.68,1:16:44.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至身负背叛之罪只为了救回托尔?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.18,1:16:45.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.26,1:16:47.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要帮忙?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.52,1:16:50.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肩负着国王的光荣
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.14,1:16:52.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我将开启彩虹之门
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.02,1:16:54.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,越搞越复杂了,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.94,1:16:56.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,接下来呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.03,1:16:59.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,看!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.67,1:17:20.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那是怎一回事啊? - 不知道啊,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.09,1:17:21.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,一时有道强大的能源指数
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.47,1:17:23.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,但随即又消失了,在西北方15英里处
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.05,1:17:25.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.37,1:17:51.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.70,1:17:53.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不用客气
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.84,1:18:03.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,第2队,我们持续监控城镇边缘
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.76,1:18:04.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,盯住目标
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.23,1:18:16.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,确保我弟兄永不能回来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.57,1:18:22.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,毁灭一切
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.08,1:18:34.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.30,1:18:44.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是在做什么文艺复兴类的展览是吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.38,1:18:45.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,回报给总部
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.38,1:18:47.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.30,1:18:52.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,发现了西嘉公主、成龙、罗宾汉之类别的人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.47,1:18:55.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是很好的臆测,珍妮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.48,1:18:59.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,但这无法让你进入科学协会里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.81,1:19:01.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,因没有证据啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.07,1:19:03.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到你啦!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.41,1:19:11.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的好友!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.53,1:19:14.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是棒啊!真是棒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.95,1:19:16.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.62,1:19:19.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,希芙女士和战士三人组
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.04,1:19:23.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友们
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.67,1:19:26.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,见到你们真是荣幸啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.55,1:19:28.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你们不该来的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.14,1:19:31.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来带你回家的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.89,1:19:34.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我回不了家了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.89,1:19:38.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我父王
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.48,1:19:40.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,是因我而死
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.56,1:19:43.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本该被放逐
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.90,1:19:45.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.53,1:19:47.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的父王还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.54,1:20:05.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我,洛基,你是怎放行寒冰巨人侵入的?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.96,1:20:09.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为彩虹桥是唯一可以传送到各国度的方法吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.30,1:20:10.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,但有一条秘密的通道
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.93,1:20:13.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你的能力无法去驾驭的,你被蒙蔽了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.72,1:20:16.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我不需要了,我是国王了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.97,1:20:18.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,基于你违抗命令
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.93,1:20:21.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我解除你的看门人职务
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.77,1:20:23.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,且你不属于神之国度的一员了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.98,1:20:26.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我就不必效忠你了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.13,1:20:50.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,找个古文学家来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.33,1:21:19.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有人要来吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.25,1:21:24.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,是史塔克的钢铁人吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.38,1:21:27.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道,史塔克什么都不会说
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.67,1:21:32.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.01,1:21:35.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在未经许可领域使用武器
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.80,1:21:36.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,报上名来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.72,1:21:41.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,果然是
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.31,1:21:46.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,快闪开!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.20,1:21:55.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮,你快走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.66,1:21:57.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 但你怎么办? - 我留下
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.91,1:21:59.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔将与我们并肩作战!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.91,1:22:01.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友们
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.66,1:22:05.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已是凡人了,留下来奋战的话,可能会有人丧命的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.75,1:22:07.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,但可以说明人们尽量逃到安全之处
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.09,1:22:10.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,若你留下,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.42,1:22:12.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 争取点时间 - 可以的!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.38,1:22:14.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点快跑啊各位!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.76,1:22:17.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,通通出去!从安全门逃出去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.55,1:22:19.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点快逃啊!你以后再吃
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.61,1:22:34.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,让它分心一点
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.17,1:22:51.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,为国度而战
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.00,1:23:28.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,撤退!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.68,1:23:45.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,快跑!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:16.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,希芙,希芙,听着你们尽力了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.84,1:24:19.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我将死得像个战士般
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.34,1:24:21.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,让后代可以传颂着
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.55,1:24:24.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,不如你活着自己来讲这经历
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.85,1:24:28.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.90,1:24:38.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们得回去"阿斯嘉特"并阻止洛基
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.11,1:24:40.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.61,1:24:43.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心我,朋友们,我自有计划
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.87,1:24:45.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.08,1:24:51.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,快撤退,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.50,1:24:52.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.38,1:25:01.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.47,1:25:10.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.46,1:25:41.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟,若我曾经做了什么对不起你的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.51,1:25:44.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论我做了什么让你得这样对待我
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.84,1:25:46.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我诚恳道歉
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.39,1:25:49.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,但请别残害无辜
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.02,1:25:54.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,若你害死他们毫无益处
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.86,1:26:03.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.11,1:26:05.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,结束这些
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.46,1:26:20.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.56,1:26:37.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,都结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.23,1:26:40.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,还没结束
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.15,1:26:43.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少你安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.40,1:26:45.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.57,1:26:46.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就是结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.91,1:26:54.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.56,1:27:13.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.50,1:27:41.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 正在失效 - 水平增加了!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.96,1:27:43.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论是谁掌握了雷神之鎚
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.17,1:27:47.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要他够资格
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.55,1:27:52.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,就能拥有雷神之力
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.24,1:28:09.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.74,1:28:14.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不!不!不! - 走吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.64,1:28:39.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.67,1:29:50.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,还原正常了?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.92,1:29:51.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.84,1:29:54.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来挺帅的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.01,1:29:58.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得赶到彩虹桥去,好让我跟我弟讲讲话
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.18,1:29:59.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.18,1:30:04.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,唐那先生
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.60,1:30:07.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好像没对我说实话喔
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.15,1:30:08.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,非无敬意
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.61,1:30:11.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和我,都是为了同一信念而战:保卫世界
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.69,1:30:13.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,而今日是你跟同事可表现之时
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.82,1:30:16.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,但先请把珍妮的所有研究资料还她
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.91,1:30:18.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 被偷的 - 借来的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.45,1:30:21.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以领回所有的器材
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.66,1:30:23.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,好让你继续你的研究
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.62,1:30:26.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想看看我讲的彩虹桥吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.08,1:30:29.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.88,1:30:32.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,我要听你汇报!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.10,1:30:41.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到"阿斯嘉特"
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.96,1:31:09.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔,开启彩虹桥
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.84,1:31:18.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.35,1:31:23.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.81,1:31:27.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,没人回应
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.94,1:31:29.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,他被控制住了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.56,1:31:32.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔!若你听到了,我们需要你协助!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.90,1:31:36.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔,我们需要你协助!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.58,1:31:43.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,海姆达尔!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.43,1:32:01.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我必须赶回我们需要你协助,但我想你保证
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.76,1:32:05.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会为你回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.69,1:32:13.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,一言为定?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.45,1:32:28.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,一言为定
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.18,1:32:47.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,快把伤者送到疗伤室!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.73,1:32:50.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,把我哥哥留给我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.17,1:33:16.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,据说
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.00,1:33:21.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你竟然还能听得见看得见
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.01,1:33:25.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.01,1:33:29.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲自体验到
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.18,1:33:36.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我劳菲杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.45,1:33:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你却是被奥丁之子给杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.87,1:33:55.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,洛基!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.33,1:33:56.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救了他!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.30,1:34:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我向你发誓,母后
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.68,1:34:06.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们将为今天所做的付出代价
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.51,1:34:07.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,洛基
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.30,1:34:09.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.39,1:34:12.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会回来
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.90,1:34:19.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎不解释为何
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.57,1:34:23.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你派出毁灭者想杀了我跟我的朋友?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.15,1:34:24.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.24,1:34:26.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不过接任"先父"的指挥权罢了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.74,1:34:29.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是老练的说谎家,兄弟,一直都是
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.24,1:34:31.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴你回得来
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.91,1:34:35.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,但很抱歉,我得先去毁灭:"乔登海姆"
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.08,1:35:18.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看着
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.50,1:35:21.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,看我怎么将"乔登海姆"给彻底毁灭
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.69,1:35:44.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.82,1:35:48.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为何要这样做?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.57,1:35:52.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想向父王证明我才是够格的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.41,1:35:55.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,当他醒来后,会知道是我救了他
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.33,1:35:58.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我平定了这些怪兽的作乱
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.12,1:36:00.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才够格戴上皇冠!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.63,1:36:02.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也不能消灭个种族的!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.71,1:36:04.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,为何不?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.84,1:36:10.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你又何时开始同情起寒冰巨人一族了呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.09,1:36:14.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你大可轻而易举的灭族啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.60,1:36:16.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我改变心意了 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.43,1:36:19.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我决斗吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.86,1:36:24.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是只要皇冠!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.11,1:36:27.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想跟你平起平坐
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.78,1:36:30.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想跟你决斗的,兄弟!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.86,1:36:32.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是你兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.03,1:36:34.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,从来不是亲兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.41,1:36:35.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,洛基,这太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.49,1:36:38.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,这疯狂吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.96,1:36:40.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.54,1:36:42.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.88,1:36:47.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知何原因让你去了地球变得如此脆弱?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.67,1:36:51.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,但请别说是为了一个女人
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.39,1:36:54.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,果然是!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.68,1:36:58.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许等我俩忙完这里后,我去给她登门拜访!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.14,1:37:43.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尔!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.82,1:37:51.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.83,1:38:04.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,够了!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.79,1:38:48.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看你自己
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.63,1:38:52.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,伟大的雷神托尔
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.05,1:38:58.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有如此的神力
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.89,1:39:01.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在又能怎样呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.89,1:39:06.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你听见了吗,兄弟?你无能为力的!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.66,1:39:25.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.67,1:39:31.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你毁了彩虹之桥,就再也没机会见到她了!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.68,1:39:42.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,原谅我,珍妮
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.84,1:40:22.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能成功的,父王!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.85,1:40:25.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能成功的!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.10,1:40:27.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,为你!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.14,1:40:29.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了我们!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.81,1:40:33.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,洛基
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.91,1:40:42.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,洛基,不
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.16,1:40:46.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.58,1:40:51.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.10,1:41:09.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,他消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.96,1:42:24.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后,随着一声强大的怒吼
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.05,1:42:29.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我飞进了那个巨大的金属生物内并放倒了它!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.31,1:42:32.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,是不是还有一种说法,你摔了个屁股朝天?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.98,1:42:38.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,事实上,下落是阻止破坏行动的一种策略...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.16,1:42:56.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,母后,很遗憾您的损失
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.84,1:43:03.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.51,1:43:07.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还在为兄弟默哀
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.84,1:43:10.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,并且...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.18,1:43:12.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还想着"她"
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.77,1:43:15.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个凡人的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.53,1:43:33.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你将是位睿智的君王
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.71,1:43:40.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,永不再有像你一般睿智的君王了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.54,1:43:43.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,或是一位好父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.10,1:43:57.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还好多要学习
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.27,1:44:00.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.78,1:44:07.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,终有一天,有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.03,1:44:10.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会让您以我为傲的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.58,1:44:20.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经以你为傲了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.35,1:44:37.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟地球失去联系了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.68,1:44:39.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.69,1:44:42.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,总是会有办法的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.69,1:44:48.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看得出来喔?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.11,1:44:52.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.12,1:44:58.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有粒子探测器!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.12,1:45:00.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,妲西,找到神盾计划的通行密码了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.29,1:45:02.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,快找到了,等等我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.46,1:45:03.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,她还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.96,1:45:06.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,快上车啊,珍妮!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.38,1:45:08.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍妮还在努力想找到你
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.04,1:53:19.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,席维克博士
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.79,1:53:24.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是幕后首脑?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.13,1:53:29.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是个迷宫啊
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.88,1:53:33.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为你叫我来是要杀我的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.98,1:53:43.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,新墨西哥州的事件我听说了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.81,1:53:48.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的工作留下了深刻印象,比我的人聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.57,1:53:50.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我做了很多的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.15,1:53:54.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,福斯特理论,进入另一纬度的通道
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.12,1:53:56.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有研究先例
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.83,1:54:00.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.50,1:54:06.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个传说告诉我们,另一个历史也告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.17,1:54:11.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,但不时,我们发现是一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.18,1:54:20.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.27,1:54:21.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,无限能量
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.93,1:54:23.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们已经发现到了使用方法
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.81,1:54:33.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,就试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.61,1:54:37.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.30,1:46:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,《雷神》
